/E (Moshe Alouf grew up in both Brooklyn, NY and Israel, giving him a unique perspective on Jewish life in the Diaspora and the Land of Israel. A proud graduate of Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim \(Class of 2017\), he went on to serve in the Israel Defense Forces where he was a sergeant. Moshe holds a degree in Education from Herzog College in Israel and is dedicated to building meaningful connections between Torah learning, personal growth and strong educational values.)
